{
  "slug": "rocketsmith",
  "name": "Rocketsmith",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Enables the use of OpenRocket and PrusaSlicer for CAD based agents to develop and simulate rockets.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **6 agents**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `design-for-additive-manufacturing` (Use when translating an OpenRocket logical design into a physical component tree for FDM/SLA 3D printing), `generate-structures` (Use when producing base geometry (tubes, cones, integrated fins, integral shoulders, motor mount wall thickening, full assembly) from…), `mass-calibration` (Use after slicing printed parts to feed measured filament weights back into the OpenRocket design as mass overrides,…), `modify-structures` (Use when applying detail features (holes, pockets, vents, mounts) to base STEP files already produced by generate-structures), `motor-selection` (Use when choosing a motor for a rocket design, or when the user asks what motor to use…), `print-preparation` (Use when slicing rocket parts for FDM printing, or when choosing print orientation and settings for a specific…), `stability-analysis` (Use when a flight returns stability outside 1.0–1.5 calibers, or when min_stability_cal is null)\n- **Agents** (6): `cadsmith` (Use this agent for CAD part generation, STEP file creation, and 3D visualization tasks using build123d), `gui` (Use this agent for managing the RocketSmith GUI — starting/stopping the server, navigating to pages, and verifying that…), `manufacturing` (Use this agent for manufacturing decisions — translating an OpenRocket logical design into a physical parts plan), `openrocket` (Use this agent for OpenRocket rocket design and flight tasks), `prusaslicer` (Use this agent for slicing 3D model files (STL, STEP, OBJ) for FDM printing using PrusaSlicer, managing printer/filament/print…), `rocketsmith` (Use this agent when you need to design, fly, and build a complete rocket end-to-end)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `rocketsmith`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rocketsmith@claude-community` from `ppak10/RocketSmith`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "agent": 6,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Peter Pak, Jesse Barkley, Rumi Loghmani"
  },
